OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal 18,000-tonne dump to be
OL,4,Acleared
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn illegal dump containing about 18,000
OL,7,Ftonnes of rubbish is set to be cleared,
OL,8,Fthe government has announced.
OL,10,FThe tip, on Bolton House Road near
OL,11,FBickershaw, Wigan, has built up since
OL,12,F2024.
OL,14,FIn July 2025, a ten-day fire broke out
OL,15,Fat the site, forcing local businesses
OL,16,Fand a school to close.
OL,18,FThe Department for Environment, Food
OL,19,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) has confirmed
OL,20,Fwork is now underway to clear the
OL,21,Fwaste, with specialist teams aiming to
OL,22,Fremove up to 25 lorry loads each day.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
